---
name: sanity-run-table
version: 1.2.0
description: Compact dev-sanity run table. Input runs are newest-first; each item is one completed iteration.
format: markdown
required_variables:
  - runs
---
| S | PR | Find | ✓ | Done | Iter |
|:--|:--|---:|:--:|:--|---:|
{% for run in runs %}| {{ run.sprint }} | {% if run.pr_number %}#{{ run.pr_number }}{% else %}—{% endif %} | {{ run.findings }} | {% if run.verdict == "PASS" %}✅{% else %}❌{% endif %} | {{ run.completed_local }} · {{ run.duration }} | {{ run.iteration }} |
{% endfor %}
